---
import Default from '@astrojs/starlight/components/Footer.astro';
import TopicNav from '../site/TopicNav.astro';
const isRu = Astro.locals.starlightRoute?.locale === 'ru';
---
<TopicNav />
<Default><slot /></Default>
<p class="lcm-attribution">
  {isRu ? (
    <>Тексты сайта — по лицензии <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/deed.ru">CC BY 4.0</a>, код — по лицензии MIT. Упражнения выполняются в вашем браузере: PostgreSQL — <a href="https://pglite.dev/">PGlite</a>, Python — <a href="https://pyodide.org/">Pyodide</a>.</>
  ) : (
    <>Site content: <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>. Code: MIT. The exercises run in your browser: PostgreSQL by <a href="https://pglite.dev/">PGlite</a>, Python by <a href="https://pyodide.org/">Pyodide</a>.</>
  )}
</p>
<style>
  .lcm-attribution { margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: var(--sl-text-xs); color: var(--sl-color-gray-3); line-height: 1.5; }
  .lcm-attribution a { color: inherit; }
</style>
